{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows启用快速助手完全控制共享。对应需求：命令控制。官方：Quick Assist Full Control Sharing Mode Enabled。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-system.application*","logs-windows.forwarded*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows启用快速助手完全控制共享","references":["https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2024/05/15/threat-actors-misusing-quick-assist-in-social-engineering-attacks-leading-to-ransomware/","https://attack.mitre.org/software/S1209/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"1b1b4236-175f-4863-89f7-7f0d2da0f0e8","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 命令控制","来源: 默认","对应需求: 命令控制"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"host.os.type:windows and winlog.channel:\"Application\" and event.provider:\"Quick Assist\" and event.code:\"0\" and\n  winlog.event_data.param1:(*FullControl* and *setsharingmode*)\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows启用快速助手完全控制共享\n\n### 为何重要\n建立外连、隧道或远程管理通道\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1219","name":"Remote Access Tools","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1219/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0011","name":"Command and Control","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0011/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
